      "notes": "Maximum ratings (VCEO 60, 80, 100 V, IC 5 A, IB 120 mA, PD 65 W at 25 C case); hFE 1000 minimum at 0.5 A and 3 A (2500 typical at 4 A); VCE(sat) 2.0 V at 3 A, 12 mA and 4.0 V at 5 A, 20 mA; VBE(on) 2.5 V at 3 A; Figure 1, the Darlington circuit with its 8.0 k and 120 ohm shunts and its diode; TO-220AB B1 C2 E3; the ordering information."
    }
  },
  "evidence": [
    "\\(IC = 0\\.5 Adc, VCE = 3\\.0 Vdc\\) 1000 − − \\(IC = 3\\.0 Adc, VCE = 3\\.0 Vdc\\) 1000",
